{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"A young halfling with sandy brown hair steps up to the bar in the old Jackalope's stead. They wipe their hands off with a black rag. \"Tha sirs a bit busy, name's Jerry. What can I do ya fer?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T01:52:56.317000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863598705658298409","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Well, uh, Jerry. I seem to have come into a bit of coin.\" I place a gold piece on the bar. \"I would like as much wine as I can purchase with this, please.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T01:54:30.771000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863599101828005899","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"Jerry picks up the coin, eyes it carefully, and bites into it. \"Aye, thas as real as ye can git I s'pose.\" They turn back to a wine rack and lift a bottle off. \"You'll be wanting yer wine bottle by bottle, aye?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T01:57:04.885000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863599748228055060","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Let's start with ah, one. And see where the night, uh takes. Us.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T01:58:59.460000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863600228792139777","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"O course, master...?\" They arch an eyebrow as they retrieve a glass for you and uncork the bottle.","created_at":"2021-07-11T02:00:16.814000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863600553238200341","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"You can call me Wintergreen. No glass necessary.\" I take a short swig from the bottle, a deep breath, then a longer pull. \"That's . . . ok. What am I, uh drinking. Here. Jerry?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T02:02:52.519000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863601206312304641","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Well, while I can't say it's top shelf. It is better than tha dregs tha swill we sell ta the Redcoats.\" Jerry takes another bottle from the shelf and examines it. \"Looks like it's a vintage from about 30 years back. Dunno where Whili gets it all, but he manages.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T02:08:21.622000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863602586669023233","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Trouble maintaining your, stock?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T02:08:55.357000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863602728165179392","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Not in tha least, just rather not sell alright wine ta those tea totellin' twerps. Wouldn't know a good wine if tha grapes grew outta there arses.\" Jerry uncorks the bottle and pours a glass for himself.","created_at":"2021-07-11T02:11:01.023000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863603255245144064","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Arse wine! Now there's a vintage.\" I tip the bottle to touch the rim to Jerry's glass before taking another pull. \"To the fruit of the cheeks!\" Laughing, I decide to put another gold piece down on the bar. \"My young friend, I am too thin. I have heard some. Say that the meat of this 'racoon' is stringy, and tough. Others have. Told me of it's robust, flavor . . . and unique texture. Tonight I aim to discover for myself.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T02:17:08.967000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863604798514397194","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"How much for the raccoon, Jerry?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T02:23:12.334000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863606322586976266","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"A plate'll be cheap, 1 sp  fer a bite ta eat.\" Jerry cheers you back.","created_at":"2021-07-11T02:26:35.785000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863607175921795083","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Delightful! I'll take one.\" (I look around the bar to see if there are any other patrons.)","created_at":"2021-07-11T02:28:34.027000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863607671864557598","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"I take my second gold piece back from the bartop and turn to go. \"Another time, perhaps. Then.\" I take my leave of the pub, carrying the bottle of wine with me.","created_at":"2021-07-11T02:48:35.274000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863612710260310056","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
